# 📚 Cybersecurity Learning Resources

Beginner-friendly resources to keep learning. All of these are legal, educational platforms designed for practice.

> ⚖️ Practice only on platforms, labs, and CTFs that give you permission to do so.

## 🏁 Practice Platforms & CTFs

| Resource | What it offers |
|----------|----------------|
| [picoCTF](https://picoctf.org/) | Beginner-friendly CTF platform with year-round practice |
| [OverTheWire Wargames](https://overthewire.org/wargames/) | Learn Linux and security basics through games (start with *Bandit*) |
| [TryHackMe](https://tryhackme.com/) | Guided learning paths and virtual labs |
| [Hack The Box](https://www.hackthebox.com/) | Hands-on labs and challenges |
| [CTFtime](https://ctftime.org/) | Calendar of CTF events worldwide |
| [CryptoHack](https://cryptohack.org/) | Learn cryptography by solving challenges |

